insightsoftware's shipped SDK, held here as evidence
----------------------------------------------------
`_run/embed-26.2.1.js` (44,422 bytes) is insightsoftware's own Embed SDK
bundle. A running Logi Composer 26.2.1 instance served it from the embed
loader path below `/discovery`, and it was copied here unmodified. It is not my
code, and nothing in this repository licenses it.

It is committed deliberately, for one purpose. `_run/verify-against-sdk.py`
reads it, so that every claim this skill makes about an SDK method, event or
config key is checked against shipped code rather than against another
document. Documentation checked against documentation is how this skill came
to teach a `trigger` method that does not exist, a `forTopic` key the SDK
silently ignores, and `EMBED/PUBLISH` as an event name when the SDK carries it
as an inner discriminator. Holding the bundle so a gate can read it is not a
licence to redistribute it as a library.

Stated plainly, so there is no room to read it any other way:

- The file belongs to insightsoftware.
- It is present as verification evidence and for nothing else.
- It is not offered for reuse, redistribution, vendoring or bundling, and this
  repository is not a distribution channel for the Composer Embed SDK.
- Do not serve it from a page, ship it inside a product, or point a customer
  at it.
- If you want the SDK, take it from your own Composer instance: it is the
  loader your server publishes under its `embed/` path, below `/composer` on
  standalone Composer or below `/discovery` on the Simba Intelligence bundle.
  The `<script src>` line in the client-side assembly section of SKILL.md shows
  the full form. Use the build your own server serves: the copy held here is
  pinned at 26.2.1 and will drift from every later release.

