Not here
--------
No customer name, no customer artefact and no credential ships in this
repository. The account and dashboard ids in the client-side example are opaque
object ids, shown to demonstrate the `accountId+dashId` form the embed manager
expects; they identify no customer. Neither gate authenticates anywhere and
neither reaches the network: they read files in this checkout, and
`verify-runnable.py` additionally shells out to a local `node --check`.

